{
 "film": "in-this-town-robot-at-18-part-2",
 "fps": 30,
 "duration": 153.9333,
 "estimated": true,
 "tempo": 1.0,
 "wordsPerMinute": 255.4,
 "audio": null,
 "clips": [],
 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.town",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.9,
   "text": "In this town, the day you turn eighteen, you get your own robot."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.head",
   "start": 2.9,
   "end": 5.6333,
   "text": "Mine was a head. Then the head turned out to be a suit."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.old",
   "start": 5.6333,
   "end": 8.3,
   "text": "Then an old man in the forest turned out to have one too."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.nora",
   "start": 8.3,
   "end": 11.8333,
   "text": "He nearly got me. Nora jumped out of a bush with her shield and saved me."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.same",
   "start": 11.8333,
   "end": 15.0667,
   "text": "Then she looked at my helmet and said, \"That is the same robot as his.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "2.took",
   "start": 15.0667,
   "end": 17.5333,
   "text": "The town took his robot away, a long time ago."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.how",
   "start": 17.5333,
   "end": 20.0333,
   "text": "So how did it end up in a crate on my doorstep?"
  },
  {
   "id": "2.mum",
   "start": 20.0333,
   "end": 23.1,
   "text": "I asked my mum. She did not know. Her butler did not know."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.dad",
   "start": 23.1,
   "end": 25.5,
   "text": "I asked my dad. He said, \"Son, I got feet.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "3.pip",
   "start": 25.5,
   "end": 28.4,
   "text": "So Nora and I went to Pip. His glasses know everything."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.scan",
   "start": 28.4,
   "end": 30.5333,
   "text": "The glasses looked at my helmet for a long time."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.zero",
   "start": 30.5333,
   "end": 33.3333,
   "text": "Then they said, \"Model zero. Only one was ever made.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "3.one",
   "start": 33.3333,
   "end": 35.3,
   "text": "One. So what was the old man wearing?"
  },
  {
   "id": "3.copy",
   "start": 35.3,
   "end": 38.9333,
   "text": "\"A copy,\" said the glasses. \"He built it himself. It took him forty years.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "3.trouble",
   "start": 38.9333,
   "end": 42.1333,
   "text": "Then they told me how much trouble I was in. It was a big number."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.night",
   "start": 42.1333,
   "end": 44.7333,
   "text": "That night, I put the helmet on my desk and asked it."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.ask",
   "start": 44.7333,
   "end": 48.0333,
   "text": "It only ever says one word at a time. So I asked small questions."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.whose",
   "start": 48.0333,
   "end": 49.1667,
   "text": "\"Whose are you?\" \"Yours.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "4.before",
   "start": 49.1667,
   "end": 50.4333,
   "text": "\"And before me?\" \"His.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "4.why",
   "start": 50.4333,
   "end": 52.9,
   "text": "\"Why me?\" The helmet waited. Then it said, \"Lunch.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "4.lunch",
   "start": 52.9,
   "end": 55.9667,
   "text": "Lunch. The day I stood up to Brick, holding nothing but a head."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.saw",
   "start": 55.9667,
   "end": 58.5333,
   "text": "It had been in my hands. It had seen the whole thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.train",
   "start": 58.5333,
   "end": 60.8333,
   "text": "He was coming back. So Nora and I trained."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.balls",
   "start": 60.8333,
   "end": 63.3,
   "text": "She threw dodgeballs at me. I dodged none of them."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.words",
   "start": 63.3,
   "end": 65.6333,
   "text": "The helmet helped. \"Left.\" \"Jump.\" \"Other left.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "5.week",
   "start": 65.6333,
   "end": 67.6333,
   "text": "After a week, I could dodge almost half."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.ready",
   "start": 67.6333,
   "end": 69.7,
   "text": "I was not ready. He came anyway."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.sky",
   "start": 69.7,
   "end": 72.4333,
   "text": "He came down out of the sky into the town square, at noon."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.robots",
   "start": 72.4333,
   "end": 74.4667,
   "text": "Every robot in town stood up to him."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.butler",
   "start": 74.4667,
   "end": 78.2,
   "text": "The butler threw a teapot. He cut it in two. The tea is still up there."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.hand",
   "start": 78.2,
   "end": 80.6667,
   "text": "The floating hand slapped him. He did not even blink."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.brick",
   "start": 80.6667,
   "end": 83.0667,
   "text": "Brick swung both giant arms. Then Brick had four small arms."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.massager",
   "start": 83.0667,
   "end": 86.1,
   "text": "My dad's foot massager did nothing. It is a foot massager."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.mine",
   "start": 86.1,
   "end": 88.6333,
   "text": "The old man pointed his blade at me. \"That suit is mine.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "7.duck",
   "start": 88.6333,
   "end": 91.4667,
   "text": "My helmet said, \"Duck.\" This time I was already ducking."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.roll",
   "start": 91.4667,
   "end": 94.9667,
   "text": "The blade went over me. I rolled between his legs and came up behind him."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.beam",
   "start": 94.9667,
   "end": 97.8667,
   "text": "I fired. He spun around and cut the beam in two, again."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.roof",
   "start": 97.8667,
   "end": 100.1333,
   "text": "He chased me up a wall and across the rooftops."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.tower",
   "start": 100.1333,
   "end": 102.7667,
   "text": "He went through a chimney. He went through the bell tower."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.bell",
   "start": 102.7667,
   "end": 105.5,
   "text": "The bell rolled down the street and landed on Brick. Brick was fine."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.sky",
   "start": 105.5,
   "end": 108.5667,
   "text": "Then we were in the sky again, and he was still better at it."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.caught",
   "start": 108.5667,
   "end": 111.2667,
   "text": "He caught my foot, spun me round, and threw me at the ground."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.table",
   "start": 111.2667,
   "end": 114.1,
   "text": "Nora slid under me and opened the shield flat, like a table."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.bounce",
   "start": 114.1,
   "end": 116.3333,
   "text": "I bounced. It does not look cool. It works."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.idea",
   "start": 116.3333,
   "end": 119.7333,
   "text": "Then I remembered. His cannon hit her shield, and the blast went straight up."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.aim",
   "start": 119.7333,
   "end": 122.2333,
   "text": "So I did not aim at him. I aimed at Nora."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.fire",
   "start": 122.2333,
   "end": 125.4667,
   "text": "She tilted the shield. The beam hit it, bent, and got him from behind."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.crack",
   "start": 125.4667,
   "end": 127.3,
   "text": "His suit cracked from the neck to the knee."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.fell",
   "start": 127.3,
   "end": 129.8,
   "text": "He fell out of the sky and made a hole shaped like him."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.stood",
   "start": 129.8,
   "end": 132.3667,
   "text": "I stood over him. Forty years of work, in pieces."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.laugh",
   "start": 132.3667,
   "end": 134.5667,
   "text": "And he laughed. \"You think they took it from me?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "10.left",
   "start": 134.5667,
   "end": 138.3,
   "text": "\"Nobody took it. One night it got up and left. It walked out of my house.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "10.picks",
   "start": 138.3,
   "end": 140.7667,
   "text": "\"Nobody picks their robot, boy. The robot picks.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "10.done",
   "start": 140.7667,
   "end": 143.6,
   "text": "\"And when it is done with you, it will pick somebody else.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "11.ask",
   "start": 143.6,
   "end": 145.3,
   "text": "I asked my helmet, \"Is that true?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "11.wait",
   "start": 145.3,
   "end": 146.5667,
   "text": "It did not say a word."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.mirror",
   "start": 146.5667,
   "end": 149.1333,
   "text": "But I could see myself in the old man's broken visor."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.red",
   "start": 149.1333,
   "end": 152.1667,
   "text": "And the light in my eyes was not blue any more. It was red."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.sub",
   "start": 152.1667,
   "end": 153.9333,
   "text": "Like and subscribe for part three."
  }
 ],
